SUMMARY:Empires die\, but the cedars remain - by Eglinton-Lawrence & Don
  Valley for Palestine
LOCATION:Hybrid
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdMWUQLbnuhaZROIcKO48maDqELdXz-m
 OdRFNZWY2JghQCa6A/viewform\n\nHosted by Eglinton-Lawrence & Don Valley for
  Palestine (https://www.instagram.com/eldv4palestine/)\n\nA fundraiser and
  teach-in for Lebanon. Join to learn more about Lebanon's natural
  history\, the flora & fauna that have inspired writers & poets for
  centuries\, and the impact of colonialism on the land and wildlife. At
  the end\, participants are encouraged to contribute original poetry or
  reflections to be assembled into a zine!
