SUMMARY:🎬$4.99 Tuesday Movie Meetup – Apocalypse Now 🎬
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n🎬 **
 Tuesday Movie Meetup – *Apocalypse Now*** 🎬\n\nJoin us for a classic 
 cinema experience this Tuesday\, April 7 at **6:30 PM** at Imagine Cinemas
  Carlton!\nWe’ll be watching the legendary war film Apocalypse Now — a
 nd at an unbeatable price of **just $4.99**\, this is one you don’t want
  to miss.\n\n🎟️ **Get your ticket here:**\n[https://omniwebticketing6
 .com/imaginecinemas/carlton/?schdate=2026-04-07&perfix=134931](https://omn
 iwebticketing6.com/imaginecinemas/carlton/?schdate=2026-04-07&perfix=13493
 1)\n\n🎬 **Watch the trailer:**\n[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FTjG-A
 ux_yQ](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FTjG-Aux_yQ)\n\n***\n\n**🎥 About
  the Movie:**\nSet during the Vietnam War\, *Apocalypse Now* follows Capta
 in Benjamin Willard on a dangerous mission deep into the jungle to assassi
 nate the rogue Colonel Kurtz\, who has descended into madness. Known for i
 ts haunting visuals\, powerful performances\, and unforgettable soundtrack
 \, the film explores the darkness of war and the human psyche.\n\n⏱️ *
 *Runtime:** 3 hours 2 minutes\n\n***\n\n👋 **Meetup Details:**\n\n* 📍
  Location: Outside **Auditorium 6**\n* Meetup time 6:15PM\n* 🕡 Showtime
 : **6:30 PM**\n* 🔎 Look for **Nick with a Meetup sign** before and afte
 r the movie outside Auditorium 6\n\n**After the movie we'll gather outside
  Auditorium 6 for a few moments to share our thoughts about the experience
 .**\n\n👍 **Flexible plans? No problem!**\nNot sure about your schedule?
  Feel free to just show up on the day—last-minute attendees are always w
 elcome.\nCome out for a great film\, meet fellow movie lovers\, and enjoy 
 one of the greatest war movies ever made—at a price that can’t be beat
 . See you there!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/toronto-movies-and-social-group/event
 s/314146084/
