SUMMARY:Kill Bill C5: Why the Building Canada Act must be repealed - by 8th
  Fire Rising
LOCATION:Virtual
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://us02web.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_F8pi6cXESHi0vSVCyy9SEw\n\nHos
 ted by 8th Fire Rising
  (https://www.instagram.com/8th_fire_rising/)\n\nJoin to hear how Carney's
  “Building Canada Act” (Bill C5) and its provincial copycats
  compromise the integrity of our lands and the health of our people in the
  interest of ramming through even more extractive fossil fuel
  infrastructure. Learn how to support Indigenous Land Defenders in
  contesting and repealing such measures.
END:VEVENT
