SUMMARY:Civic Meetup – Organizing for Civic Technology - by Civic Tech
  Toronto
LOCATION:Hybrid
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://guild.host/events/civic-meetup-537-digging-sdz6ix\n\nHosted by
  Civic Tech Toronto (https://civictech.ca/)\n\nCivic Tech Toronto's weekly
  meetups bring together Torontonians who want to improve the city through
  design\, tech\, and data. This week\, hear from The Local’s Wency Leung
  talk about how local journalism counters eroding government transparency.
  Followed by project breakout sessions.
END:VEVENT
