SUMMARY:⛰️ 🛫 ITALY (the Alps of Trentino) Hiking Trip Presentation 
 – WED\, Apr 8
DESCRIPTION:Hiking Network\n⭐️⭐️ Join our ONLINE event to chat abo
 ut our guided hiking adventure in the spectacular mountains of Trentino (I
 taly) this summer (July 2026) ⭐️⭐️\nGrab your favorite beverage an
 d log on to our online event to introduce you to our upcoming trip to the 
 **Val di Sole** region of the **Alps**\, in the province of Trentino. Conn
 ect with your host – **Walter De Marco** (hike leader and Meetup organiz
 er) and other attendees for this informative and interactive presentation.
 \n\n⭐️ Online registration via **Eventbrite** required to attend. ⭐
 ️\n\n⭐️ **TOUR DETAILS** ⭐️\n**Dates: July 25–31\, 2026** • 
 7 Days / 6 Nights\n**Difficulty level:** Beginner/ Intermediate (some hiki
 ng experience required)\n\n• **Price:** From EUR 1\,550.00 pp\nFlight NO
 T incl.\n\n⭐️⭐️ **[>> Learn more HERE <<](https://www.meetup.com/h
 ikingnetwork/events/313243928/)**\n\n⭐️⭐️ **[Please\, CLICK HERE](
