SUMMARY:Here comes the Sun: Driving a Renewable Energy Revolution - by
  Seniors for Climate
LOCATION:Virtual
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://us02web.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_CaaTWVrqSlaVfw5L44pMJg#/regis
 tration\n\nHosted by Seniors for Climate
  (https://seniorsforclimate.org/)\n\nA timely discussion with climate
  author and activist Bill McKibben. McKibben will answer important
  questions\, and speak about his latest book\, Here Comes the Sun\,
  exploring why renewable energy is now poised to transform the world.
END:VEVENT
