SUMMARY:Look Again: A Meditative Museum Experience
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260409T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260425T140000
UID:f7334950bdc16d2aa536eb01de57aeba@toronto.ca
DESCRIPTION:Explore the different galleries through guided meditation tech
 niques. Each session focuses on practices such as deep looking\, body scan
 ning\, sensory foraging\, and reflective riddles\, encouraging attendees t
 o reconnect with their senses and experience museum objects in fresh\, sur
 prising ways. The program includes shared reflection after each activity\,
  fostering connection and conversation. At the end\, participants may join
  a larger group discussion or quietly return to the galleries to continue 
 their visit. Many discover new perspectives and gain practical meditative 
 tools for daily life.
LOCATION:Royal Ontario Museum\, 100 Queen's Park\, Toronto\, ON
URL:https://www.rom.on.ca/whats-on/special-programs/conversations
X-SOURCE:City of Toronto Festivals & Events
END:VEVENT
