DESCRIPTION:Sheridan Graduate Show: Still\, After            \n                                \n    \n\n\n\n	\n\n	\n\n\n			\nEvents\n	\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    \n        \n             \n                \n                    April 10 – 26\, 2026\nThe Hilary and Galen Weston Foundation Hall. Ground Floor\nIncluded with admission. Free for Gardiner Members. \n\n                \n                    \n    \n\n\n\n    \n         \n    \n\n\n\n\n	\n\n\n  Get Tickets\n\n\n\n  Become a Member\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    \n         \n    \n\n\n\n\n    \n        \n             \n                \n                    Meet the next generation of ceramic artists in this exhibition showcasing the work of Ceramics graduates from the Bachelor of Craft and Design program at Sheridan College. \n\n                \n                    \n    \n\n\n\n    \n         \n    \n\n\n\n\n    \n        \n             \n                \n                    The Artists \n\n                \n                    \n    \n\n\n\n    \n        \n             \n                \n                    Charlotte Bridge\nEleanora Joseph Miles Debono\nIvy Hills\nHyemin Kim\nSeren Kwasniewski-Burke\nAlyssa Laffrenier\nChloe Lipczynski\nNatalia Lopez\nErin Merkley\nJolie Neeve\nThomas Paik\nAmanda Silvestre\nVera Urban \n\n                \n                    \n    \n\n\n\n    \n         \n    \n\n\n\n\n\n  \n              \n                    \n                Presenting Partner\n                \n                                \n                            \n            \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n    \n         
