SUMMARY: High Tea EP Release w\\ Inquiète/Unquiet
DESCRIPTION:High Tea -Split/Fissure EP Release\n\nSupported by Inquiète/U
 nquiet\n\n\n\nNo-Gen Club Presents a début. Brought to live above Low.\n\
 nThe Rat’s Nest\n\n\nHigh Tea are a catchy breed of Alternative Noisey Ro
 ck with a signature of Arithmetic.\n\n\nTheir debut 2026 EP is « Split/Fi
 ssure »\n\n\nInquiète/Unquiet\n\n\nDescribed as Anxiety in a quartet. An 
 itch that can’t be scratched. Soothes with an anti melodic slurry of spac
 e and quirky sonic meditations at times punky at other times noisey.\n\n\
 nExplore the new sounds of Toronto this event is a No-Gen Club Joint.
