SUMMARY: JMFEST JYOU (上): J-POP LIVE IN TORONTO - Featuring MADKID × Zenb
 u Kimi no Sei da
DESCRIPTION:Toronto\, get ready for an unforgettable night of Japanese po
 p music as MADKID and Zenbu Kimi no Sei da take the stage for a special o
 ne-night-only live concert at JMFEST JYOU 2026.\n\nThis electrifying even
 t brings together two dynamic acts from Japan’s modern music scene\, each
  known for high-energy performances\, powerful sound\, and strong connect
 ions with their audiences. From explosive anthems to emotionally charged 
 moments\, fans can expect a nonstop\, immersive live experience.\n\nMADKI
 D is a Japanese boy group recognized worldwide for their blend of powerfu
 l vocals and rap\, with hit anime theme songs including The Rising of the
  Shield Hero\, Junji Ito Maniac\, and Sasaki and Peeps. Following their s
 uccessful Canadian debut and North American tour\, MADKID returns to Toro
 nto to deliver another high-impact performance.\n\nZenbu Kimi no Sei da i
 s a groundbreaking presence in Japan’s alternative music scene\, with an 
 extensive discography including 20 singles and 7 albums. They have perfor
 med at major venues across Japan\, including Nippon Budokan\, and are now
  entering a bold new era as they approach their 10th anniversary with a m
 assive international world tour.\n\nWhether you’re a longtime J-pop fan o
 r discovering it for the first time\, JMFEST JYOU 2026 promises a powerfu
 l\, unforgettable night in the heart of Toronto.\n\nTickets from $35\n\nD
 oors: 6:30pm\nShow: 7:00 pm\n\nVIP Package includes Meet & Greet\, Photo 
 Op and more!\n\ntdmusichall.mhrth.com/tickets/jmfest https://tdmusichall.
 mhrth.com/tickets/jmfest\n http://j-rocknorth.com\n\n http://jmfest.com\n
 \n
