SUMMARY:Union Samples : Boost Kids
DESCRIPTION:There’s a new kid in town! Stop by from 7:00 am to 7:00 pm to get a little BOOST with BOOST Kids Essentials and Fruit Essentials. With 4 delicious flavours to love\, each serving is packed with 8g of Protein\, 2g of fibre\, and 26 essential vitamins and minerals to support normal growth and development!  \nHours may vary\, sampling might start later or be cut short due to sample availability; breaks will be taken throughout the day. Guests are not permitted to stand or wait near the kiosk during these times.\nWe ask everyone to remain respectful and polite to our staff at all times. Failure to follow these guidelines will result in being denied a sample.\n 
