 tup does not send out emails to\neveryone in a group) to get our weekly ne
 ws later about upcoming events: [http://eepurl.com/hKt76f](http://eepurl.c
 om/hKt76f)\nFacebook group @ [http://www.facebook.com/groups/5029451130627
 39/](http://www.facebook.com/groups/502945113062739/)
