SUMMARY: ReMode\, Toronto's Circular Fashion Festival
DESCRIPTION:ReMode https://fashiontakesaction.com/remode-toronto is a cir
 cular fashion festival\, organized by Fashion Takes Action (FTA) https://
 fashiontakesaction.com to inspire\, educate\, and activate citizens aroun
 d sustainable fashion. The upcoming Toronto event\, will feature educatio
 nal programming (The Talks) (12-2pm)\, a vendor marketplace (with no NEW 
 clothes) (11am-5pm)\, a series of engaging workshops hosted by Evergreen 
 Brick Works\, and a clothing swap hosted by The Good Swap https://www.eve
 ntbrite.ca/e/the-good-swap-at-remode-2026-tickets-1981822767246?keep_tld=
 true (Swap 2pm - 4pm).\n\n\nWhere: https://www.evergreen.ca/evergreen-bri
 ck-works/\, 550 Bayview Ave\, Toronto https://www.evergreen.ca/evergreen-
 brick-works/\n\nWhen: Sunday\, Apr 19\, 2026\, from 11am-5pm
