DESCRIPTION:In this hands-on workshop\, children will learn the basics of 
 drawing digitally using the popular website Canva.\nThis is an in-person e
 vent intended for ages 8-12. Computers and peripherals will be provided. 
 Register online.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information
  on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the\nPublic
  Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will 
 only be used for\nevent and program registration\, delivery and evaluation
 . Questions about how the library\nhandles your information can be directe
 d to Answerline staff at answerline@tpl.ca\, 416-397-\n5981\, 789 Yonge St
 reet\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
