DESCRIPTION:We will demo the HTC Vive Virtual Reality platform. Registrati
 on required. **Please note the manufacturers recommended age is 12+\nWelco
 me to the\nVirtual Reality Arcade\nevent at the Toronto Public Library - R
 ichview Branch! Get ready to immerse yourself in a world of cutting-edge t
 echnology and endless fun.\nStep into a world where reality meets fantasy\
 , where you can explore new worlds and embark on thrilling adventures. Whe
 ther you're a seasoned gamer or new to virtual reality\, there's something
  for everyone at this event.\nDon't miss out on this opportunity to try th
 e latest VR games and experiences. Grab your friends and family and come j
 oin us for an evening of excitement and entertainment. See you there!
LOCATION:Richview
