SUMMARY:Michael - the life and legacy + Pre-Dinner (Bay Station)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nOn **Friday April 24th\,** let's see **Mic
 hael\,** **the cinematic portrayal of the life and legacy of one of the mo
 st influential artists the world has ever known**. The film tells the stor
 y of Michael Jackson’s life beyond the music\, tracing his journey from 
 the discovery of his extraordinary talent as the lead of the Jackson Five\
 , to the visionary artist whose creative ambition fueled a relentless purs
 uit to become the biggest entertainer in the world. Highlighting both his 
 life off-stage and some of the most iconic performances from his early sol
 o career\, the film gives audiences a front-row seat to Michael Jackson as
  never before. This is where his story begins.. **My seat is K22. Purchase
  your tickets for Michael on Friday April 24th at the regular 7:10pm show 
 at Cineplex Varsity.**\n\n**COST**\n$15.70 or CineClub $9.99 + fees\n\n**S
 IGNING UP**\n\n* **Simply RSVP Yes confirming Yes/No to food/drinks after*
 *\n* **[Purchase](https://www.cineplex.com/movie/michael-2026?ic=cpx_hp-mo
 viegrid-8)** **your own ticket by selecting Advance Tickets\, Varsity Cine
 ma\, Friday April 24th\, Regular Show at 7:10pm**\n* You can also meet the
  group at the meetup time with your ticket in hand\n* RSVPs close the day 
 prior\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me for dinner at: 5:30pm in front of Scac
 cia on the lower level of the Manulife Building\, at 55 Bloor St. W.**\n\n
 **Meet me for the movie at: 7pm in front of Auditorium 3 inside Cineplex V
 arsity after scanning your ticket**\n\n**Show starts**: 7:10pm\n\nLength: 
 2 hours 10 minutes\n\nAfter: meet me outside Auditorium 3 to head out and 
 chat about the movie\n\nEnjoy and please post your comments in the event a
 fter.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/experiencetoronto/events/314095513/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260402T212929Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260402T212929Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
