URL:https://tockify.com/torevent/detail/16333/1777075200000
SUMMARY: Nuraya Free event - The Resonance Readings
DESCRIPTION:Resonance is an intimate gathering by Nuraya\, bringing toget
 her music\, DJs\, art\, and connection in a carefully curated atmosphere.
 \n\nJoin Nuraya's first party !\n\nThrough DJ sets\, visual art\, tarot r
 eadings\, and immersive elements\, the space transforms into a shared exp
 erience shaped by energy and creativity.\n\nFriday\, April 24th (8pm - 2a
 m).\n\n📍 Location: Toronto Downtown | Dundas west\n\nTickets are free - 
 RSVP to get the password for entry (no entry without password).\n\n\nThem
 e: Tarot × Spring\nGuests are invited to dress within the theme and becom
 e part of the atmosphere.\n\n\nA small ritual:\nEach guest is encouraged 
 to bring a small gift or object to offer to someone during the night.\n\n
 About Nuraya\nNuraya is a creative community and event series based in To
 ronto\, curating intimate experiences where art\, music\, and energy alig
 n. Through recurring gatherings\, Nuraya aims to build meaningful connect
