DESCRIPTION:Experience the commemoration of the 213th Anniversary of the B
 attle of York with special tours and demonstrations. Discover the battle's
  impacts on the city\, this land and its peoples. Join the special Anishin
 aabeg Defenders of York battlefield tour and learn the stories of Toronto'
 s Indigenous defenders. Excite your imagination with musket and music demo
 nstrations\, historic kitchen animations\, special presentations and more.
  Special battlefield tours take place at noon & 2 p.m.
LOCATION:Fort York National Historic Site\, 100 Garrison Rd\, Toronto\, ON
