DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260428T170000
UID:69b863292866a5b488427ecc@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Tunnel book greeting cards are 3D\, accordion-folded papercraf
 ts that create a layered\, diorama-like scene\, often viewed through a cen
 tral cutout on the cover. These intricate cards\, which fold flat for mail
 ing\, simulate depth and perspective\,\nThis program is part of Youth Hub 
 service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and in th
 e summer\, where helpful staff are always available. Free\, nutritious sn
 acks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the b
 ranch to find out more.
