SUMMARY:Graphic Novel Club for kids: Clementine Fox and the Great Island A
 dventure
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260428T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260428T170000
UID:69c1692767801235ed73f7dd@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join Lillian H. Smith’s new graphic novel book club happenin
 g on the last Tuesday of every month! April’s pick is\nClementine Fox an
 d the Great Island Adventure.\nJoin us for a discussion & Craft! Books wil
 l be made available at the first-floor desk.\nRegistration and drop in are
  welcome!\nBooks will be made available at the first-floor desk. For ages 
 8-12.
LOCATION:Lillian H. Smith\, Room BC
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69c1692767801235ed73f7dd
