UID:90515f84f119865f2fda2a9800aa5601@toronto.ca
DESCRIPTION:Check out our website for an overview deck to learn more about
  me\, and both our organization and project. In essence\, TISAS 26 is a gl
 obally focused Street Art conference meets mural festival in one\, with a 
 speakers plus workshop series\, live mural painting as a spectator sport\,
  A film festival\, family programming\, music \, and more. its big\, to sa
 y the least! We're inviting over 100 of the world's best and brightest str
 eet artists to participate in painting\, speaking and teaching\, bringing 
 new color city wide.
