SUMMARY:Youth Hub: Craft Clear Out
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260522T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260522T170000
UID:699df529403a4e5652dd51f5@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Help us clear out our closet space by getting creative with ou
 r leftover craft supplies! Available supplies will include items from past
  programs such as paint\, canvases\, wooden ornaments\, shadow boxes\, ter
 racotta pots\, mason jars\, and more.\nThis is a drop-in Youth Hub program
  for\nteens only\n. No registration required. Materials are limited. Arriv
 e early to ensure your space.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. 
 Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\
 , where helpful staff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are 
 offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to 
 find out more.
LOCATION:Don Mills\, Auditorium
