SUMMARY:Wexford Mini Repair Café
CLASS:PUBLIC
STATUS:CONFIRMED
LOCATION:Scarborough Citadel Child Care – 2021 Lawrence Ave E\, Scarborou
 gh\, ON M1R 2Z2\, Canada
DESCRIPTION:Hi! Join our Repair Café on May 23rd from 10am to 1pm. The goa
 l of repair cafes is to promote reuse and repair instead of wasting resour
 ces. The event will be organized in Wexford at the Scarborough Citadel at 
 2021 Lawrence Ave. East and will invite neighbours to bring their clothes\
 , small appliances and jewellery to be repaired. We are looking for volunt
 eers to help us sew and repair clothes as well as small appliances. If you
  want to help\, contact us please! Registration ends at 12:30. Looking for
 ward to seeing you there! The Scarborough Zero Waste Team!
GEO:43.745087;-79.2950581
CATEGORIES:Midi Event
