 r Cafe\, Swansea Town Hall is offering a variety of eco-friendly services 
 to the neighbourhood at this Spring community event. If you are coming by 
 public transit\, Swansea Town Hall is about 8 minutes' walk from Runnymede
  Subway. If you are driving\, there is some street parking and a parking l
 ot behind the building. Swansea Town Hall is a not-for-profit community re
