DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260527T173000
UID:69ac973c491b809c6f1ed39d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Drop in and share a   favourite book or story you’ve read to
 gether. Read a passage\, tell us about   your favourite character or share
  something new you’ve discovered. Don’t   forget about non – fiction
 \, too!\nRelax and Chat!
