UID:69711e66992fc18a86deb254@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:On Wednesdays\, the Eatonville Youth Hub becomes a quiet space
  for teens to study\, work on projects\, and request homework help and res
 ume help from staff. Bring your homework and enjoy a snack in a space that
  is just for teens.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs
  are a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\, where he
 lpful staff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered da
 ily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out m
 ore.
LOCATION:Eatonville
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69711e66992fc18a86deb254
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
