UID:69cd2f0b66c3387a9d0577b6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Did you attend some of the Pop-Up Learning Lab Programs this m
 onth\, but have more questions about 3D Printing\, 3D Design\, Photography
 \, Video Editing or any other topics we covered? The Creators Corner is n
 on-instructional program where participants from past programs can come b
 ack and ask more questions\, share ideas\, mingle\, talk shop\, or just g
 et some extra practice.\nMacBooks and other equipment are available for us
 e during the program on a first come first serve basis.\nInformation Colle
 ction Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the T
 oronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20
 (c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and program r
 egistration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library han
