 ny Masks\nApril 7 - Bulldozing with Dash\nSnacks are offered during the A
 fter School Club for participants.\nFood may contain or have come into con
 tact with common allergens. Ingredient lists will be available. Snacks are
  generously supported\, in part\, by donors.\nIf you or your child lives w
 ith a disability\, and requires an accessibility accommodation to particip
 ate in this program\, please contact Accessibility Services by email\, acc
 essibleservices@tpl.ca\, or voicemail\, 416-393-7099\, to make a request. 
 Please contact us at least three weeks in advance.
