DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260603T163000
UID:693f0b1b4be11d3d00d817bf@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come out to our Afte
 r School Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids and have
  fun! Drop-in\, space is limited.\nApril 1: Connect 4 and UNO Tournaments\
 nApril 8: Snap Circuits\nApril 15: Fun with Sphero\nApril 22: Plant Pot P
 ainting ( Materials Limited )\nApril 29: Perler beads\nSnacks are offered 
 during the After School Club for participants.\nFood may contain or have c
 ome into contact with common allergens. Ingredient lists will be available
 . Snacks are generously supported\, in part\, by donors.
LOCATION:Weston\, Program Room. Lower Level.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/693f0b1b4be11d3d00d817bf
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
